cases/td6_c1_c2_c3_high_q_total_f_k_repair_v89h4_aws_20260826/V87_HOSTILE_REVIEW.md:317:- **Inert `B` as a missing live path.** FIRST/P12 read `Q_PRIME`, not `B`. The two live paths are independently omit-controlled on FIRST. Direct first keys are the `q'` slots.
cases/td6_c1_c2_c3_high_q_total_f_k_repair_v89h4_aws_20260826/V87_HOSTILE_REVIEW.md:318:- **Self-referential omissions.** Path omissions rebuild FIRST from altered compiler state. Row omissions subtract used multiplier terms.
